# Pan is dry/wet: swept from 0 (dry) to 128 (fully wet) and on to 255 (still wet) on FX1, with the level at 200 and a
# track gain of 0.8.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2
track fx1
input impulse 2 0.6
preset 120 180 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 0 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep pan 0 255 0 32
gain 0.8
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below -1
